<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquie (2007) CYP26A1-Mediated RA Degradation Reaction-Diffusion Law" ;
    dct:description "Couples posterior FGF8/Wnt signaling to CYP26A1-mediated enzymatic clearance of anterior Retinoic Acid in the presomitic mesoderm | Variables: R(x,t): anterior Retinoic Acid concentration (nM); F(x,t): posterior FGF8/Wnt signaling (nM); C(F): CYP26A1 Hill activation; v_sc: RALDH2 RA synthesis rate (nM/min); k_d1, k_d2: CYP26A1 and basal RA degradation rates (min^-1)" ;
    dct:source "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquie (2007) Dev. Cell / Dev. Dyn. 236(6):1495-1508 Eqs. 1-4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py#L189-L222>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_025_fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront.lean#L24-L52> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def ra_cyp26_kinetic_residual (v_sc k_d1 C_F k_d2 R : Int) : Int :=
  v_sc - (k_d1 * C_F + k_d2) * R
theorem goldbeter_2007_ra_cyp26_steady_balance (k_d1 C_F delta_C k_d2 R : Int) :
    ra_cyp26_kinetic_residual ((k_d1 * C_F + k_d2) * R) k_d1 C_F k_d2 R = 0 ∧
    ra_cyp26_kinetic_residual ((k_d1 * C_F + k_d2) * R) k_d1 (C_F + delta_C) k_d2 R =
      -(k_d1 * delta_C * R)"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "dR/dt = D_R * d^2R/dx^2 + v_sc(x) - k_d1 * C(F) * R - k_d2 * R,  R*(F) = v_sc / (k_d2 + k_d1 * C(F))" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(00)80451-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0896-6273(03)00565-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2007.05.015>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2005.07.019>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature03488>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1108363> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Bistable Morphogen Wavefront Arrest (RA-FGF8/Wnt Mutual Antagonism & Saddle-Node Hysteresis)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_025.ra_cyp26_kinetic_residual" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_025.goldbeter_2007_ra_cyp26_steady_balance" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquie (2007) Saddle-Node Bistable Hysteresis S-Curve Law" ;
    dct:description "Establishes the bistable hysteresis loop [M_1, M_2] that converts a shallow exponential fgf8 mRNA gradient into an ultra-sharp all-or-none determination front switch (Delta_x_front << lambda_M) | Variables: M(F): inverse steady-state fgf8 mRNA concentration as a function of FGF8 protein F; M_1, M_2: lower and upper saddle-node bifurcation thresholds (nM); K_I: Hill inhibition constant for RA repression of fgf8 translation" ;
    dct:source "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquie (2007) Dev. Cell / Dev. Dyn. 236(6):1495-1508 Figs. 2-4" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py#L223-L290>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_025_fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront.lean#L54-L79> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def hysteresis_window_width (M_1 M_2 : Nat) : Nat :=
  M_2 - M_1
theorem goldbeter_2007_hysteresis_window_width (M_1 delta_M : Nat) (h : 0 < delta_M) :
    hysteresis_window_width M_1 (M_1 + delta_M) = delta_M ∧
    0 < hysteresis_window_width M_1 (M_1 + delta_M) ∧
    hysteresis_window_width M_1 M_1 = 0"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "M(F) = (k_dF * F / k_s) * (1 + (R*(F) / K_I)^n),  Delta_M = M_2 - M_1 > 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(00)80451-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0896-6273(03)00565-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2007.05.015>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2005.07.019>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature03488>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1108363> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Bistable Morphogen Wavefront Arrest (RA-FGF8/Wnt Mutual Antagonism & Saddle-Node Hysteresis)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_025.hysteresis_window_width" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_025.goldbeter_2007_hysteresis_window_width" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Baker, Schnell & Maini (2006) / Goldbeter et al. (2007) Opposing RA-FGF Wavefront Shift & Somite Scaling Law" ;
    dct:description "Predicts compressed somites when the bistable front shifts anteriorly under Vitamin A Deficiency (VAD) or ectopic FGF8 beads, and enlarged somites when the front shifts posteriorly under exogenous RA or SU5402 | Variables: S_n: anteroposterior somite length (um); v_g: posterior tailbud elongation velocity (um/min); T_c: segmentation clock period (min); delta_x: determination front shift induced by VAD / exogenous RA / SU5402 / FGF8 bead (um)" ;
    dct:source "Baker, Schnell & Maini (2006) J. Theor. Biol. 239:413-429 & Goldbeter et al. (2007) Dev. Dyn. 236:1495-1508 Figs. 5-7" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py#L1165-L1292>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_025_fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront.lean#L81-L105> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def bistable_somite_length (v_g T_c delta_x : Int) : Int :=
  v_g * T_c - delta_x
theorem baker_2006_ra_fgf_opposing_somite_shift (v_g T_c delta_x : Int) :
    bistable_somite_length v_g T_c delta_x +
      bistable_somite_length v_g T_c (-delta_x) = 2 * (v_g * T_c) ∧
    bistable_somite_length v_g T_c (-delta_x) -
      bistable_somite_length v_g T_c delta_x = 2 * delta_x"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "S_n = v_g * T_c - Delta_x_front_n;  S_vad + S_ra = 2 * v_g * T_c" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(00)80451-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0896-6273(03)00565-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2007.05.015>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2005.07.019>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature03488>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1108363> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Bistable Morphogen Wavefront Arrest (RA-FGF8/Wnt Mutual Antagonism & Saddle-Node Hysteresis)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_025.bistable_somite_length" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_025.baker_2006_ra_fgf_opposing_somite_shift" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Lewis (2003) Delayed Her1/Hes7 Autoinhibition Oscillator Period Law" ;
    dct:description "Supplies the delayed negative-feedback segmentation clock whose protein peaks gate the bistable RA-FGF switch inside the competence window, producing saltatory cohort arrest; Notch-Delta coupling synchronises neighbouring cells (in-phase at T_N ~ T_osc, anti-phase at T_N ~ T_osc/2) | Variables: m_j(t), p_j(t): her1/hes7 mRNA and protein in PSM cell j; T_m, T_p: transcription and translation delays (min); a, b, c, k, p0: Lewis (2003) rate constants; N_j(t): delayed saturating Notch-Delta input from adjacent cells with delay T_N and strength eps_N; T_osc: clock period (min)" ;
    dct:source "Lewis, J. (2003) Current Biology 13:1398-1408 Eqs. 1-3, Fig. 2 & Fig. 4; chick period from Palmeirim et al. (1997) Cell 91:639-648" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py#L434-L812>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_025_fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront.lean#L107-L134> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def lewis_delayed_oscillator_period (T d : Nat) : Nat :=
  2 * (T + d)
theorem lewis_2003_delayed_oscillator_period (T d delta_T : Nat) :
    lewis_delayed_oscillator_period (T + delta_T) d =
      lewis_delayed_oscillator_period T d + 2 * delta_T ∧
    2 * T ≤ lewis_delayed_oscillator_period T d ∧
    lewis_delayed_oscillator_period 34 8 = 84"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "dm/dt = k * f(p(t - T_m)) * N(t) - c * m;  dp/dt = a * m(t - T_p) - b * p;  f(p) = 1 / (1 + (p/p0)^2);  T_osc ~ 2 * (T_m + T_p + 1/b + 1/c)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(00)80451-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0896-6273(03)00565-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2007.05.015>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2005.07.019>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature03488>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1108363> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Bistable Morphogen Wavefront Arrest (RA-FGF8/Wnt Mutual Antagonism & Saddle-Node Hysteresis)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_025.lewis_delayed_oscillator_period" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_025.lewis_2003_delayed_oscillator_period" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquie (2007) / Lewis (2003) Clock-Gated Saltatory Cohort Arrest Additivity Law" ;
    dct:description "Formalises Goldbeter et al. (2007) Fig. 10: the bistable switch must stay competent for at least one clock cycle so that the clock, not the gradient, times the arrest, yielding discrete somite-scale cohorts; Notch ablation collapses cohorts toward single cells | Variables: n: cells per arrest cohort; a: PSM cell spacing (um); k: clock cycle index; S = n * a: segment length (um); x(M_1), x(M_2): axial positions of the saddle-node thresholds bounding the bistability (clock-competence) window" ;
    dct:source "Goldbeter, Gonze & Pourquie (2007) Dev. Dyn. 236:1495-1508 Fig. 10 & Discussion; Lewis (2003) Current Biology 13:1398-1408" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py#L499-L523>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_025_fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront.lean#L136-L159> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def cohort_axial_extent (n a k : Int) : Int :=
  k * (n * a)
theorem goldbeter_2007_saltatory_cohort_additivity (n a k : Int) :
    cohort_axial_extent n a (k + 1) - cohort_axial_extent n a k = n * a ∧
    cohort_axial_extent 1 a (k + 1) - cohort_axial_extent 1 a k = a"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "cell j arrests when x_j(t) in [x(M_2), x(M_1)] and p_j peaks;  cohort k spans S = n * a;  extent(k+1) - extent(k) = n * a" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(00)80451-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0896-6273(03)00565-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2007.05.015>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2005.07.019>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature03488>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1108363> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Bistable Morphogen Wavefront Arrest (RA-FGF8/Wnt Mutual Antagonism & Saddle-Node Hysteresis)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_025.cohort_axial_extent" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_025.goldbeter_2007_saltatory_cohort_additivity" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront-6> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Vermot & Pourquie (2005) Retinoic Acid-Buffered Left-Right Symmetry of the Determination Front" ;
    dct:description "Models the 2D bilateral paraxial mesoderm: anterior RA buffers the lateralizing bias so wild-type somites form synchronously left and right, whereas Raldh2-/- / VAD / disulfiram embryos develop a one-somite left-right desynchronisation whose side flips under situs inversus | Variables: b_LR: unbuffered lateralizing bias from the embryonic LR cascade; K_buf, h: RA buffering half-saturation (nM) and Hill coefficient; R_ant: anterior RA level (nM; 2.5 WT, 0.8 VAD); x_0: shared wild-type front position (um); Delta_x_LR: left-right determination-front offset (um)" ;
    dct:source "Vermot, J., Gallego Llamas, J., Fraulob, V., Niederreither, K., Chambon, P. & Dolle, P. (2005) Science 308:563-566; Vermot & Pourquie (2005) Nature 435:215-220" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/2012-baker-fgf-wnt-bistable-wavefront.py#L817-L1026>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_025_fgf_wnt_bistable_wavefront.lean#L161-L187> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def lr_front_offset (x_0 b_eff : Int) : Int :=
  (x_0 + b_eff) - (x_0 - b_eff)
theorem vermot_2005_ra_buffered_lr_symmetry (x_0 b_eff : Int) :
    lr_front_offset x_0 0 = 0 ∧
    lr_front_offset x_0 b_eff = 2 * b_eff ∧
    lr_front_offset x_0 (-b_eff) = -(lr_front_offset x_0 b_eff)"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "b_eff = b_LR * K_buf^h / (K_buf^h + R_ant^h);  v_sc,L = v_sc * (1 - b_eff), v_sc,R = v_sc * (1 + b_eff);  Delta_x_LR = (x_0 + b_eff) - (x_0 - b_eff) = 2 * b_eff" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1002/dvdy.21193>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(00)80451-1>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0092-8674(01)00437-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0896-6273(03)00565-8>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/S0960-9822(03)00534-7>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.devcel.2007.05.015>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jtbi.2005.07.019>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ydbio.2006.01.018>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1038/nature03488>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.1108363> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Bistable Morphogen Wavefront Arrest (RA-FGF8/Wnt Mutual Antagonism & Saddle-Node Hysteresis)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_025.lr_front_offset" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_025.vermot_2005_ra_buffered_lr_symmetry" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

